From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mstask: EditWorkItem property sheet, Clone, task flags (3651)

mstask: EditWorkItem property sheet, IEnumWorkItems::Clone, task flags, SaveCompleted

ITask::EditWorkItem shows Task, Schedule and Settings pages and saves the task on OK.
IEnumWorkItems::Clone copies the enumeration position. SetTaskFlags/GetTaskFlags store
the value, IPersistFile::SaveCompleted succeeds, the documented-unimplemented error
retry methods are quiet.
---
